/**
 * @component BpWeChatCustomTabBarStyle
 * @lang zh-CN 微信常驻 custom tabBar 的字面样式适配：视觉值与当前 HIA-uView `u-tabbar` 默认浅色契约一致，但不复制组件运行时或取得路由所有权。
 * @lang en Literal-style adapter for the persistent WeChat custom tab bar: visual values align with the current HIA-uView `u-tabbar` default-light contract, but it copies no component runtime and acquires no routing ownership.
 */

/* <lang><zh-CN>平台 custom-tab-bar 根始终固定在安全区上方并占满底边；它在 tab 页面切换时不随页面 slot 卸载。</zh-CN><en>The platform custom-tab-bar root remains fixed above the safe area and spans the bottom edge; it does not unmount with page slots during tab switches.</en></lang> */
.bp-custom-tabbar {
  position: fixed;
  z-index: 30;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  display: flex;
  gap: 4px;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  min-height: 57px;
  padding: 6px 6px calc(6px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  border-top: 1px solid #f7f9fc;
  background: #ffffff;
}

/* <lang><zh-CN>每项保留均分宽度、44px 最小触控高度和文字选中态，不加载图标、字体或图片。</zh-CN><en>Each item retains equal width, a 44px minimum touch target, and a textual selected state, loading no icon, font, or image.</en></lang> */
.bp-custom-tabbar__item {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 44px;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 8px 4px;
  border: 0;
  border-radius: 6px;
  background: transparent;
  color: #27364a;
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: normal;
}

/* <lang><zh-CN>移除微信 button 的默认伪元素边框，避免与 HIA-uView 风格产生双边框。</zh-CN><en>Remove WeChat button's default pseudo-element border, avoiding a double border against the HIA-uView visual contract.</en></lang> */
.bp-custom-tabbar__item::after { border: 0; }

/* <lang><zh-CN>选中态同时使用表面、前景与字重，不只依赖颜色差异。</zh-CN><en>The selected state uses surface, foreground, and weight together rather than relying on color alone.</en></lang> */
.bp-custom-tabbar__item--active {
  background: #f7f9fc;
  color: #0047ab;
  font-weight: 600;
}

/* <lang><zh-CN>单行标签在小屏空间不足时截断，不改变实际 locale 文案。</zh-CN><en>The single-line label truncates when small-screen space is insufficient without changing actual locale copy.</en></lang> */
.bp-custom-tabbar__label {
  display: block;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
